    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/001/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hello traveler, I could really use your help!
      - Bonjour voyageur, j'aurais bien besoin de votre aide !
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/002/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yes of course
      - Oui bien sur
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/003/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Found some wood? Thank you so much, here's your reward!
      - "Vous avez trouv\xE9 du bois? Mille merci voici votre r\xE9compense !"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/005/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You're welcome, don't hesitate if you need anything else.
      - "De rien, n'h\xE9sitez pas si vous avez besoin d'autres"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/006/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I need some wood but my son is sick and I have to stay with him, could you
        go get me some?
      - "J'aurais besoin de bois mais mon fils est malade et je dois rest\xE9 pr\xE9s
        de lui, pourriez allez m'en chercher?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Carpenter.Greetings/Entry/007/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yes of course
      - Oui bien sur
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/001/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Welcome stranger to our noble village! What are you doing here?
      - "Bienvenu \xE9tranger dans notre noble village! Que venez vous faire par
        ici?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/002/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '#VALUE!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/004/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '#VALUE!'
