      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/006/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I'm just a simple traveler, or my adventures brought me here! I help people
        I meet for a few coins, so if help is needed, I'm your man!
      - "Je ne suis qu'un simple voyageur, ou mes aventures m'on amen\xE9 ici ! J'aide
        les personnes que je rencontre contre quelques pieces donc si aide il y'a
        besoinn je suis votre homme !"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/007/Mayor/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Well, we can say that you've come at a good time. Recently the village has
        had some problems, particularly with the streetlights which no longer work
        properly. Could you take a look at what's going on?
      - "Et bien, on peut dire que vous tombez bien dernierement le village a eu
        quelque probl\xE9mes, nottament au niveau des lampadaires qui ne marches
        plus correctement, si vous pourriez regardez ce qu'il se passe?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/Mayor.Greetings/Entry/010/Player/Dialogue
        Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '#VALUE!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
